      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that's actually exactly what I needed to hear. I'm going to go with that framing then—that it's a targeted, predictable fix that won't touch the core architecture. \n\nI just want to be 100% sure before I hit send on this email to the board. Since you've done the audit, can you give me a definitive 'yes' that the architectural integrity of the auth module remains intact and we aren't looking at a redesign? I need to be able to tell them this is a contained issue.",
